# Build-context exclusions.
# M5: fixed the `venv/`-vs-`.venv/` typo and added data_backup/ -- together they
# baked ~3 GB of dead weight into the image (verified: /app/.venv 660 MB,
# /app/data_backup 2.3 GB present in the pre-M5 image). Everything listed here is
# either runtime-mounted by docker-compose.yml (data/, .env), host-only
# (.venv/, .git/), or a frozen legacy snapshot that must never ship
# (data_backup/ -- pre-migration copies, kept on the host until sign-off).
data/
venv/
.venv/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
.env
.git/
data_backup/
